    "qty = number of packs/units ordered, from the item line's 'xN'.",
    "sub = Subtotal (unit x qty, pre-shipping, pre-discount). tot = Total actually charged, which INCLUDES shipping and any discount.",
    "tot > sub means shipping was added. tot < sub means a checkout discount. Neither is 'the item price' on its own.",
    "Orders before ~2019 no longer render Subtotal/Total or an estimated delivery date - only the item line survives.",
    "eta = 'Estimated delivery date' as shown on the detail page. This is the field InvenTree target_date wants and currently has for only 3 of 67 POs."
